{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/48afa99cd14270705a33a438b2e4fc73.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=100 /></span>In A game <strong>based on true events</strong>, featuring <strong>mysterious Eastern forces and large-scale exorcism rituals</strong>, offering an immersive experience of Taiwan\u2019s unique folk tradition of <strong>Pagui</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/96b4ae3faf2f8c2d8cd542393c1e4f29.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of either the <strong>Forces of Light</strong> or the <strong>Powers of Darkness</strong> in an <strong>asymmetrical 3-vs-1 battle mode</strong>, engaging in an intense showdown between <strong>light and darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s settings are based on <strong>real locations in Taiwan</strong>, such as <strong>Alishan</strong>, an <strong>abandoned hospital</strong>, and <strong>Chiayi Train Station</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/bf3f41e688d4812e7d9ce94992c3709f.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these perilous locations, the dark forces have erected forbidden altars. Sensing the disturbance, the human side intervenes with force, aiming to destroy them one by one before chaos spreads, and ultimately put an end to the sinister plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/85d45f9e01f55c67c33565f42cfc66b7.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Lost Souls<br>A vengeful spirit bound to the battlefield \u2014 a restless ghost with no master \u2014 <strong>secretly aids the ghost\u00a0 players</strong>, joining them in <strong>defending what they see as their home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, ghost players are too weak to confront the human side directly. They must <strong>rely on traps, cursed artifacts, and the support of the Wandering Soul Lord</strong> to <strong>hide, delay, and resist the human team\u2019s efforts to destroy the altars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/c7530925ccd5c3f13fb90e212d00f9e8.avif?t=1756291912\" width=800 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Tools of the Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During character selection, ghost players can choose <strong>4 types of sinister artifacts</strong>, each enabling a distinct playstyle\u2014such as <strong>Assassin Build</strong>, <strong>Spirit Summoner</strong>, or <strong>Kiting Tactics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement of these tools along key routes or in areas that lure human players is crucial for <strong>triggering traps and turning the tide of battle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/420285e6feda35aa2b59c84076358661.avif?t=1756291912\" width=574 height=522 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human side must quickly gather resources while pursuing the wraith. If an altar is found, destroy it as soon as possible. But don\u2019t let your guard down\u2014during the destruction, the ghost can strike unexpectedly and steal your soul, scaring you out of your wits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time comes, the ghost will enter a frenzy and confront the humans head-on, marking the beginning of the final life-or-death showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can be customized with the Talent System to create unique strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/2bfb1b961960bd84c8c440c2f89f1a5c.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>For example, Fallen Taoist can use talents to transform a straight laser into a rotating \u2018Electric Maze Rod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the green-faced Guan Jian Shou can find the Five Thunder Talismans during the game and pair them with the right talents, their jumping attack can be transformed into a powerful triple lightning strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players have a chance to obtain 'Fate Tablet,' which add random elements to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/6cffd4514bcc782d3c598f38b3a0f65e.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you join the righteous forces that exorcise evil, or side with the dark powers that seek to defy fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/4cfcfcc1271bbfb71f08753e6e376626.avif?t=1756291912\" width=630 height=100 /></span>\u2022 Gameplay demonstrating martial arts straight from modern practitioners and masters. State-of-the-art motion capture technology allows players to experience the true power of Taiwanese martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Spells are based on Taoist practices, reproduced digitally under the guidance of Taoist priests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve unique puzzles and beat mini-games that combine elements of Taiwanese culture and religion, such as moon blocks and the Tao's divine bagua.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take in a new musical style that merges oriental musical instruments with metal and electronic music. The soundtrack has been professionally produced to induce a movie-like enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The haunted houses and temples within are real. The production team personally scouted these areas and conducted field investigations, experiencing many &quot;spiritual phenomena&quot; along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Support for multiple languages, including Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Russian, French, German, Spanish and Portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Supports Windows</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Buddha Smiles upon You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/7557caf4fdda441e69658c1e70635643c1dc6616.jpg"},{"name":"Divine Permission!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/e848800196b428a52e593d7b49d757abd19c5dc6.jpg"},{"name":"Justice Shall Prevail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/74f44f4b89af1a7e97f9d6dbf819c1a9cbf1135c.jpg"},{"name":"Die Hard, Live Harder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/0a3a2991376c319d0fe91d015deeba73f165b40b.jpg"},{"name":"Entry-Level Taoist Priest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/ef47af705fc9dbf3eebc2831dc0a26ff3e7a11e5.jpg"},{"name":"Lam Ching-Ying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/5b5824c59547ea203970b58b47c7dd188d90fdbe.jpg"},{"name":"Jhong Kuei","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/aab6c959ffd2be97df9d1fe61b599ad7b9fa739c.jpg"},{"name":"Goddess of Radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/cdf844b1c2fbc3fe465acbd548dd561f4221e8d7.jpg"},{"name":"Items to the Rescue!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/df0e2820d603c51d74de319ac091753ee1c0cc9a.jpg"},{"name":"Death, It's Inevitable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/986680/ff2b4cb5fc6af17964fbe6fb42b1993a19e69bfb.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/986680?t=1756291912","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/4064a068e7fd4f734a99169eff7f6614d6e9a85f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756291912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756291912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756291912","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/48afa99cd14270705a33a438b2e4fc73.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=100 /></span>In A game <strong>based on true events</strong>, featuring <strong>mysterious Eastern forces and large-scale exorcism rituals</strong>, offering an immersive experience of Taiwan\u2019s unique folk tradition of <strong>Pagui</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/96b4ae3faf2f8c2d8cd542393c1e4f29.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of either the <strong>Forces of Light</strong> or the <strong>Powers of Darkness</strong> in an <strong>asymmetrical 3-vs-1 battle mode</strong>, engaging in an intense showdown between <strong>light and darkness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/f870c95fab1684ba44ba90b40ed87419.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s settings are based on <strong>real locations in Taiwan</strong>, such as <strong>Alishan</strong>, an <strong>abandoned hospital</strong>, and <strong>Chiayi Train Station</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/bf3f41e688d4812e7d9ce94992c3709f.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/54d0c117c50c1e9edc1ff1ed18401ea8.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these perilous locations, the dark forces have erected forbidden altars. Sensing the disturbance, the human side intervenes with force, aiming to destroy them one by one before chaos spreads, and ultimately put an end to the sinister plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/85d45f9e01f55c67c33565f42cfc66b7.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=100 /></span>Lost Souls<br>A vengeful spirit bound to the battlefield \u2014 a restless ghost with no master \u2014 <strong>secretly aids the ghost\u00a0 players</strong>, joining them in <strong>defending what they see as their home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, ghost players are too weak to confront the human side directly. They must <strong>rely on traps, cursed artifacts, and the support of the Wandering Soul Lord</strong> to <strong>hide, delay, and resist the human team\u2019s efforts to destroy the altars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/c7530925ccd5c3f13fb90e212d00f9e8.avif?t=1756291912\" width=800 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/e58537bc92851e2e3b5f0d8dced82dec.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Tools of the Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During character selection, ghost players can choose <strong>4 types of sinister artifacts</strong>, each enabling a distinct playstyle\u2014such as <strong>Assassin Build</strong>, <strong>Spirit Summoner</strong>, or <strong>Kiting Tactics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement of these tools along key routes or in areas that lure human players is crucial for <strong>triggering traps and turning the tide of battle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/420285e6feda35aa2b59c84076358661.avif?t=1756291912\" width=574 height=522 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human side must quickly gather resources while pursuing the wraith. If an altar is found, destroy it as soon as possible. But don\u2019t let your guard down\u2014during the destruction, the ghost can strike unexpectedly and steal your soul, scaring you out of your wits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3090b6c4fb5e2d8e1b1d41bd123fd03c.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time comes, the ghost will enter a frenzy and confront the humans head-on, marking the beginning of the final life-or-death showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/3f07cc12a895ca9c3ee54edb884e00b6.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can be customized with the Talent System to create unique strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/2bfb1b961960bd84c8c440c2f89f1a5c.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>For example, Fallen Taoist can use talents to transform a straight laser into a rotating \u2018Electric Maze Rod.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/25d64464a12c1b30db791d875bc47096.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the green-faced Guan Jian Shou can find the Five Thunder Talismans during the game and pair them with the right talents, their jumping attack can be transformed into a powerful triple lightning strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.poster.avif?t=1756291912\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.webm?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/ee25bb0614b9a4db17618cd65b4f6d5a.mp4?t=1756291912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players have a chance to obtain 'Fate Tablet,' which add random elements to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/6cffd4514bcc782d3c598f38b3a0f65e.avif?t=1756291912\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you join the righteous forces that exorcise evil, or side with the dark powers that seek to defy fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/extras/4cfcfcc1271bbfb71f08753e6e376626.avif?t=1756291912\" width=630 height=100 /></span>\u2022 Gameplay demonstrating martial arts straight from modern practitioners and masters. State-of-the-art motion capture technology allows players to experience the true power of Taiwanese martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Spells are based on Taoist practices, reproduced digitally under the guidance of Taoist priests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solve unique puzzles and beat mini-games that combine elements of Taiwanese culture and religion, such as moon blocks and the Tao's divine bagua.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take in a new musical style that merges oriental musical instruments with metal and electronic music. The soundtrack has been professionally produced to induce a movie-like enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The haunted houses and temples within are real. The production team personally scouted these areas and conducted field investigations, experiencing many &quot;spiritual phenomena&quot; along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Support for multiple languages, including Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Russian, French, German, Spanish and Portuguese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Supports Windows</p>","developers":["padendon"],"dlc":[3969840,3970000,3547950,3678680,1161450,1161460,2102050,2102510],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/986680/8819b355515f18e6f27f4b2208d93f8082dd1349/header.jpg?t=175